resented on  each planet by the leader of the Great  House which held planetary fiefdom the  Farah lucha system was flawed of course  as I mentioned in my house Harkonnen  video the harkonnens who were once  banished for their actions during the  Battle of Corinne were able to rise to  the status of a great house through  manipulation of the market Leto the  second saw through his prescient vision  that the father lucius system must end  it was necessary for his golden path he  knew that humanity would never survive  as long as it could be ruled by a single  interest he saw that a great scattering  was necessary to prevent humans from  stagnating and eventually going extinct  if a single individual could rule over  all of humanity then a single threat  could also destroy it after the  scattering following the death of the  worm God Emperor late to the second the  Great Houses did real father lucha  system was never reconstituted each  great house was a single entity amongst  a disjointed society consisting of many  groups vying for power it is noted in  the novel dune that the father lucius  class system was not rigidly guarded on  the planet Arrakis the desert dwelling  Freeman were not marked down on any  Imperial census no one knew exactly how  many of them actually existed the Fremen  in that sense lived outside of the  ordered security of the father Lucius  [Music]  you  [Music]
 

